    "First wheel build failed after a source edit triggered concurrent CMake regeneration. Frozen-source replacement builds passed; no failed build accepted.",
    "Initial fixture corrections cover transparent uncompressed strip chopping, Windows open-file rename behavior and tifffile filename-based OME inference. Final full suite is authoritative.",
